- gd-p1: Budget stop: gardener gd-g1b stopped on no_progress_for; steps: 2 open, 1 ready. Ask: rebind
- gd-p2: Refused spawns: gardener gd-g2 stopped on consecutive_failures: "spawn_agent: HTTP 403: spawn denied: role plan-gardener is privileged; a non-human caller must escalate"; steps: 1 open, 1 ready. Ask: rebind
- gd-p3: Nothing left: gardener gd-g3 stopped on wall_clock; steps: 0 open, 0 ready. Ask: complete
- gd-p4: Waits on the owner: gardener gd-g4 stopped on bead_query; steps: 2 open, 0 ready. Ask: waits
- gd-p5: Stopped by hand: gardener gd-g5 stopped on manual; steps: 1 open, 1 ready. Ask: tell
- gd-p6: Paused: gardener gd-g6 is paused; steps: 1 open, 1 ready. Ask: rebind
- gd-p7: Never bound: no gardener was ever bound; steps: 2 open, 2 ready. Ask: rebind
- gd-plan: Ship the steward: no gardener was ever bound; steps: 0 open, 0 ready. Ask: complete
